                                "sense_id": "cd265988-de5d-3723-9eb3-7d07f200d7e8",
                                "text": "After Nakuru the light remains only long enough to see the Lake Nakuru, away to the south, with its fringe of pink flamingos, and as the darkness falls the old main line to Kisumu branches to the left."
                            }
                        ]
